&lt;p&gt;From: O.F.R., To: Grace Chandler&lt;br&gt;
Mailed From: Iowa on May 18, 1913&lt;br&gt;
Picture Info: Burlington Hotel, Burlington, Iowa&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Miss Grace Chandler&lt;br&gt;
Pearl, Illinois&lt;br&gt;
CTA&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;5/18/13&lt;br&gt;
Received letter. No, I won’t tell. Will answer soon. Some hotel, eh?&lt;br&gt;
O.F.R.&lt;br&gt;
x my room (x on the picture marked where the person’s room is)&lt;/p&gt;</description>
